OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry today with plenty of sunny
OL,6,Fspells, and lighter winds compared to
OL,7,Frecent days. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,8,Fsunshine. Thin layers of cloud may
OL,9,Fspill in at times to turn the sunshine
OL,10,Fa little hazy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with clear skies at first
OL,13,Fleading to a chilly night. Cloud will
OL,14,Fthicken in the early hour, perhaps
OL,15,Fbringing a little rain over the hills.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FLargely cloudy on Monday,
OL,18,Falthough bright spells are likely at
OL,19,Ftimes. Light rain or drizzle will
OL,20,Fcontinue over higher ground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
