OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWarm
OL,6,Fsunny spells and light winds on
OL,7,FTuesday. Heavy rain moves through on
OL,8,FWednesday, and feeling fresher. Dry
OL,9,Fwith sunny spells on Thursday.
